{
  "name": "RSS to Airtable with AI Processing and Multi-Method Scraping",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "📋 Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 460,
        "height": 420,
        "content": "# RSS Feed Article Processor\n\n## What This Workflow Does:\n1. ✅ Fetches articles from RSS feeds (scheduled)\n2. ✅ Checks Airtable for duplicate URLs\n3. ✅ Scrapes full article content using 3 methods:\n   - 🔹 Apify API (primary)\n   - 🔹 Firecrawl API (secondary)\n   - 🔹 HTTP Request with headers (tertiary)\n   - 🔹 RSS content (fallback)\n4. ✅ Generates AI summary of article\n5. ✅ Creates new content based on article\n6. ✅ Saves everything to Airtable\n\n## Required Setup:\n- RSS feed URL\n- Airtable API credentials\n- Airtable Base ID and Table name\n- OpenAI API key\n- Apify API key (optional)\n- Firecrawl API key (optional)\n\n## Schedule:\nRuns every 30 minutes (configurable)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cron-trigger",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.cron",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        780,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "triggerTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyX",
              "value": 30,
              "unit": "minutes"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Runs every 30 minutes. Adjust schedule as needed."
    },
    {
      "id": "manual-trigger",
      "name": "Manual Trigger (Testing)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        780,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {},
      "notes": "Use this for testing. Disable in production."
    },
    {
      "id": "rss-feed-read",
      "name": "RSS Feed Reader",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.rssFeedRead",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $env.RSS_FEED_URL || 'https://example.com/feed' }}"
      },
      "notes": "Set RSS_FEED_URL environment variable"
    },
    {
      "id": "airtable-list",
      "name": "Get Existing Articles from Airtable",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1220,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "list",
        "application": "={{ $env.AIRTABLE_BASE_ID }}",
        "table": "={{ $env.AIRTABLE_TABLE_NAME || 'Articles' }}",
        "additionalOptions": {
          "fields": [
            "URL"
          ]
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "airtableApi": {
          "id": "airtable_credentials",
          "name": "Airtable API"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Fetches existing article URLs for deduplication"
    },
    {
      "id": "split-batches",
      "name": "Process Articles One by One",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1440,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Process each RSS article individually"
    },
    {
      "id": "function-dedupe",
      "name": "Check for Duplicates",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.function",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1660,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "// Get the current article URL from RSS\nconst currentUrl = items[0].json.link;\n\n// Get existing URLs from Airtable\nconst existingArticles = $node[\"Get Existing Articles from Airtable\"].json;\n\n// Check if URL already exists\nlet isDuplicate = false;\nif (existingArticles && existingArticles.fields && existingArticles.fields.URL) {\n  const existingUrls = existingArticles.fields.URL;\n  isDuplicate = existingUrls.includes(currentUrl);\n}\n\n// Add duplicate flag to item\nitems[0].json.isDuplicate = isDuplicate;\nitems[0].json.articleUrl = currentUrl;\nitems[0].json.articleTitle = items[0].json.title || 'Untitled';\nitems[0].json.articlePubDate = items[0].json.pubDate || new Date().toISOString();\nitems[0].json.rssContent = items[0].json.content || items[0].json.contentSnippet || '';\nitems[0].json.rssSummary = items[0].json.contentSnippet || '';\n\nreturn items;"
      },
      "notes": "Checks if article URL already exists in Airtable"
    },
    {
      "id": "if-duplicate",
      "name": "Is Duplicate?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1880,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "boolean": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$json.isDuplicate}}",
              "value2": true,
              "operation": "equal"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Skip if article already exists"
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-scraping",
      "name": "🌐 Web Scraping Methods",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2040,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1280,
        "height": 180,
        "content": "# Article Scraping with Multiple Fallback Methods\n\nThis workflow tries 4 different methods to get full article content, in order:\n1. **Apify** (web scraping service) - Best for complex sites\n2. **Firecrawl** (web scraping API) - Good for general content\n3. **Direct HTTP Request** - Works for simple sites\n4. **RSS Content** - Uses the content already in the feed (fallback)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "http-apify",
      "name": "Try Apify Scraper (Method 1)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [
        2120,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/apify~web-scraper/runs",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "method": "POST",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "startUrls",
              "value": "=[{\"url\": \"{{$json.articleUrl}}\"}]"
            },
            {
              "name": "pageFunction",
              "value": "=async function pageFunction(context) { return { content: document.body.innerText }; }"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "apify_auth",
          "name": "Apify API"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Requires APIFY_API_KEY in header auth. Set neverError=true for fallback.",
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "id": "if-apify-success",
      "name": "Apify Success?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2340,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "number": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$json.$statusCode}}",
              "value2": 200,
              "operation": "equal"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Check if Apify succeeded"
    },
    {
      "id": "set-apify-content",
      "name": "Extract Apify Content",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        2560,
        280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "fields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "fullArticleContent",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$json.data?.content || ''}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "scrapingMethod",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Apify"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Parse and store Apify response"
    },
    {
      "id": "http-firecrawl",
      "name": "Try Firecrawl API (Method 2)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [
        2560,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.firecrawl.dev/v0/scrape",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "method": "POST",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "url",
              "value": "={{$json.articleUrl}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "formats",
              "value": "=[\"markdown\", \"html\"]"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "firecrawl_auth",
          "name": "Firecrawl API"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Requires FIRECRAWL_API_KEY in header auth. Set neverError=true for fallback.",
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "id": "if-firecrawl-success",
      "name": "Firecrawl Success?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2780,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "number": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$json.$statusCode}}",
              "value2": 200,
              "operation": "equal"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Check if Firecrawl succeeded"
    },
    {
      "id": "set-firecrawl-content",
      "name": "Extract Firecrawl Content",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        3000,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "fields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "fullArticleContent",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$json.data?.markdown || $json.data?.html || ''}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "scrapingMethod",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Firecrawl"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Parse and store Firecrawl response"
    },
    {
      "id": "http-direct",
      "name": "Try Direct HTTP Request (Method 3)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [
        3000,
        580
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{$json.articleUrl}}",
        "method": "GET",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "User-Agent",
              "value": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36"
            },
            {
              "name": "Accept",
              "value": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,image/webp,*/*;q=0.8"
            },
            {
              "name": "Accept-Language",
              "value": "en-US,en;q=0.5"
            },
            {
              "name": "Accept-Encoding",
              "value": "gzip, deflate, br"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "redirect": {
            "redirect": {
              "followRedirects": true,
              "maxRedirects": 5
            }
          },
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "text"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "notes": "Direct HTTP request with browser-like headers",
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "id": "if-http-success",
      "name": "HTTP Request Success?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3220,
        580
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "number": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$json.$statusCode}}",
              "value2": 200,
              "operation": "smallerEqual"
            },
            {
              "value1": "={{$json.$statusCode}}",
              "value2": 299,
              "operation": "largerEqual"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notes": "Check if HTTP request succeeded (2xx status)"
    },
    {
      "id": "html-extract",
      "name": "Extract Article from HTML",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.htmlExtract",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3440,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "sourceData": "responseData",
        "dataPropertyName": "data",
        "extractionValues": {
          "values": [
            {
              "key": "articleContent",
              "cssSelector": "article, .post-content, .entry-content, .article-content, main, .content",
              "returnValue": "text"
            },
            {
              "key": "articleHtml",
              "cssSelector": "article, .post-content, .entry-content, .article-content, main, .content",
              "returnValue": "html"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Extracts article content from common HTML selectors"
    },
    {
      "id": "set-http-content",
      "name": "Extract HTTP Content",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        3660,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "fields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "fullArticleContent",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$json.articleContent || $json.data || ''}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "scrapingMethod",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "HTTP Request"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Parse and store HTTP response"
    },
    {
      "id": "set-rss-fallback",
      "name": "Use RSS Content (Fallback)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        3440,
        680
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "fields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "fullArticleContent",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$json.rssContent || $json.rssSummary || 'No content available'}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "scrapingMethod",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "RSS Fallback"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Use RSS feed content as last resort"
    },
    {
      "id": "merge-content",
      "name": "Merge All Paths",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        3880,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "combine",
        "combinationMode": "mergeByPosition",
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Combine all scraping paths back together"
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-ai",
      "name": "🤖 AI Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        4040,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 920,
        "height": 180,
        "content": "# AI Content Processing\n\nTwo AI operations are performed on each article:\n1. **Summarization**: Creates a concise summary of the full article\n2. **Content Generation**: Writes new, original content based on the article"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-summarize",
      "name": "Generate AI Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        4100,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "prompt": {
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are an expert at summarizing articles. Create a concise, informative summary that captures the main points and key insights of the article. Keep the summary between 150-200 words."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "=Please summarize this article:\n\nTitle: {{ $json.articleTitle }}\n\nContent:\n{{ $json.fullArticleContent }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3,
          "maxTokens": 500
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "openai_credentials",
          "name": "OpenAI API"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Creates concise summary of article"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-generate",
      "name": "Generate New Content",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        4320,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "prompt": {
          "messages": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a creative content writer. Based on the provided article, create a new, original piece of content that expands on the topic with fresh insights, examples, or perspectives. The content should be engaging and informative, approximately 300-400 words."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "=Based on this article, create new, original content:\n\nTitle: {{ $json.articleTitle }}\n\nOriginal Article:\n{{ $json.fullArticleContent }}\n\nCreate content that adds value beyond the original article."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.7,
          "maxTokens": 1000
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "openai_credentials",
          "name": "OpenAI API"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Generates new content based on article"
    },
    {
      "id": "set-final-data",
      "name": "Prepare Data for Airtable",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        4540,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "fields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "URL",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$json.articleUrl}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Title",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$json.articleTitle}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Published Date",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$json.articlePubDate}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Full Content",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$json.fullArticleContent}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "AI Summary",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$node['Generate AI Summary'].json.message?.content || 'Summary not available'}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Generated Content",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$node['Generate New Content'].json.message?.content || 'Content not generated'}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Scraping Method",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$json.scrapingMethod}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Processed Date",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$now.toISO()}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "RSS Source",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$env.RSS_FEED_URL}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Format data for Airtable insertion"
    },
    {
      "id": "airtable-append",
      "name": "Add to Airtable",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        4760,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "application": "={{ $env.AIRTABLE_BASE_ID }}",
        "table": "={{ $env.AIRTABLE_TABLE_NAME || 'Articles' }}",
        "addAllFields": false,
        "fields": {
          "field": [
            "URL",
            "Title",
            "Published Date",
            "Full Content",
            "AI Summary",
            "Generated Content",
            "Scraping Method",
            "Processed Date",
            "RSS Source"
          ]
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "airtableApi": {
          "id": "airtable_credentials",
          "name": "Airtable API"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Saves article data to Airtable"
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-complete",
      "name": "✅ Complete",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        4920,
        340
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 300,
        "height": 200,
        "content": "# Workflow Complete!\n\nArticle has been:\n✅ Scraped\n✅ Summarized\n✅ Enhanced with AI\n✅ Saved to Airtable\n\nLoop continues until all RSS articles are processed."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "error-handler",
      "name": "Error Handler",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3000,
        800
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "message": "=Workflow error at {{ $node.name }}: {{ $json.error?.message }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Catches critical errors"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "cron-trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "rss-feed-read",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "manual-trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "rss-feed-read",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "rss-feed-read": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "airtable-list",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "airtable-list": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "split-batches",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "split-batches": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "function-dedupe",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "function-dedupe": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "if-duplicate",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "if-duplicate": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "split-batches",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "http-apify",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "http-apify": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "if-apify-success",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "if-apify-success": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "set-apify-content",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "http-firecrawl",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
